<title>USA: Fred's Inc Q4 net per share rises.</title>
<headline>Fred's Inc Q4 net per share rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>FRED'S INC.</p>
<p>		     Unaudited Financial Highlights</p>
<p>			 (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			   13 Wks     14 Wks     52 Wks	53 Wks</p>
<p>			    Ended	Ended	Ended	 Ended</p>
<p>			   Feb 1,     Feb 3,     Feb 1,	Feb 3,</p>
<p>			    1997	  1996	 1997	  1996</p>
<p> Net sales	   $118,228   $124,143   $418,297    $410,086</p>
<p> Operating income     3,409	1,334     10,068	 4,771</p>
<p>Net income</p>
<p>			    2,079/a	784	5,806/a     2,733</p>
<p>Net income</p>
<p>  per share	     .22/a	  .08	.62/a	   .29</p>
<p>Average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	   9,321	9,324	9,325	 9,322</p>
<p>(a) Includes after-tax restructuring charges of $1,802,000 or $.19 per share, partially offset by a one-time tax benefit of $1,650,000 or $.18 per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
